'''Arcane Confluence''' ('''魔導書の示す場所''', ''Madōsho no Shimesu Basho'', '''The Place Indicated by the Spellbook''') is one of the first three [[Empress' Research]] maps, alongside [[Servant of Darkness]] and [[Demon's Park]]. It has four stages and disappears for the rest of the day after clearing one, so it will take at least 4 days to clear the whole map. Once completed, the [[Wicked Cat]] event will be unlocked. This event was added in [[Version 10.8 Update|Version 10.8]].

